`Da sleek, but grotesque many-legged insectoid`w~
`Da sleek, but grotesque many-legged insectoid`w~
`DThe insectoid slithers forth on its many legs, its sleek carapace gleaming with a sickly iridescence that seems to pulsate with an otherworldly glow. Its elongated body writhes and twists, revealing a grotesque array of appendages that writhe and contort like something out of a nightmare. Its eyes, multifaceted and cold, bore into your very soul, filling you with an overwhelming sense of dread and unease. As it skitters ever closer, its clicking mandibles chittering and chattering in a sickening rhythm, causing one to feel a deep revulsion for this abomination that should never have existed in this world.`w
